.TXT 3 0 400 0
Cg a67.250000,67.000000,327
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
}
{\plain {At each time period (corresponding
 to the transmission of a symbol) the output
 of one\par of the four bandpass filters
 will be greater than the others.  By comparing
 the peak outputs of the envelope detectors
 at the center of each time period, we can
 determine the frequency of transmission
 and hence the dibit transmitted.  }}
}
